prehensive guide for managing oropharyngeal dysphagia. It includes healthcare professionals, dietary recommendations, and recipes tailored for patients with swallowing difficulties, emphasizing a multidisciplinary approach to dysphagia management.\n\n## Central role of the Manual de Disfagia Orofaringea\n\nThe 'Manual de Disfagia Orofaringea' serves as the cornerstone of this community, providing essential guidelines for the assessment and management of oropharyngeal dysphagia. It encompasses a wide range of topics, including dietary adaptations, rehabilitation exercises, and safety protocols for patients with swallowing difficulties. This resource is utilized by healthcare professionals, caregivers, and patients alike, making it a vital tool in the multidisciplinary approach to dysphagia management. The manual's comprehensive nature ensures that it addresses the diverse needs of individuals suffering from dysphagia, thereby enhancing their quality of life. [Data: Reports (1857); Entities (44); Relationships (1148, 1201, 1132)]\n\n## Importance of dietary management\n\nDietary management is a critical aspect of dysphagia care, as highlighted by the various recipes and nutritional guidelines included in the manual. The manual emphasizes the need for tailored dietary recommendations, including texture modifications and liquid viscosities, to ensure safe swallowing for patients. Specific recipes, such as 'Coliflor con Bechamel' and 'Puré de Garbanzos', are designed to meet the nutritional needs of individuals with dysphagia while also being palatable. This focus on nutrition is essential for preventing malnutrition and dehydration, which are common risks for patients with swallowing difficulties. The integration of specific dietary guidelines ensures that patients receive appropriate nutrition while managing their swallowing challenges. [Data: Reports (1857); Entities (1449, 950, 1273, 272, 1279); Relationships (1273, 272)]\n\n## Role of healthcare professionals\n\nHea